# Shell scripts must run on Linux (the Docker host / containers) regardless
# of which OS checked them out - force LF so a Windows clone can't silently
# reintroduce CRLF into a script's shebang/body (shellcheck SC1017; a CRLF
# shebang line can fail outright on Linux with "bad interpreter").
*.sh text eol=lf

# TypeScript/JS/JSON/HTML/CSS: Prettier formats to LF, so check them out as LF on every
# OS. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows turns every file into a
# Prettier failure on a fresh clone.
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
